  {
   "title": "the World of Willow",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>No detail was forgotten, as key elements of the film were intertwined with the interior of the venue, including actual props and costumes from the show for guests to pose with. </p>",
     "right": "<p>Serving as the photo moment, a backdrop featuring a polished metal, die-cut WILLOW logo projected from the surface to create a 3D effect. Layers of faux foliage and winding tree vines, transformed it into a forest-inspired environment.</p>"
    },
